  // Sorted by key. Most keys are only requested on an instance where the field,
  // filter or browse index exists, so they cannot collide with another one:
  //  - dc.*, education.*: the full-item-page table looks them up by field name
  //    (getTranslation(mdEntry.key), QREPO-413);
  //  - search.filters.*: derived from the filter names in discovery.xml; browse.*,
  //    menu.section.browse_global_by_*: from webui.browse.index.* in local.cfg
  //    (QREPO-460, QREPO-487). There is no fallback: a missing key shows raw;
  //  - *hierarchical_subjects_*, subjectHU/EN/DE: the Baptud tree browses (QREPO-486).

